{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend your home and its treasures against a bandit invasion using inventive boobytraps as a Trapper, or join a team of three Bandits and try to get away with the loot!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introducing <strong>BANDIT TRAP</strong>\u2014a fresh 3vs1, chaotically fun, physics-driven online multiplayer game for the whole family. And yes, we're including a procedurally slapstick damage feature to really fry, blast, burn, soak, scratch, squash &amp; knock those pesky Bandits out!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Trapper_Header_Banner.jpg?t=1747081884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Trapper_Prepare.gif?t=1747081884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Setup tons of boobytraps to defend your house from storming bandits. Use the Trapper Towers to keep watch and strategically place a wide variety of traps hidden in furniture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Trapper_Defend.gif?t=1747081884\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Activate your traps remotely from Trapper Towers or enter trapped furniture and attack bandits directly for more damage. Knock-out the Bandits to 100% Damage to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Bandit_Header_Banner.jpg?t=1747081884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Bandit_Invade.gif?t=1747081884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategise with your crew, choose the right gear, perks and map out tactics before the match starts. Choose wisely and outsmart the Trapper with the right setup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Bandit_Loot.gif?t=1747081884\" />Evade traps, fight the Trapper and master a huge variety of scanners and tools to loot hidden treasures.\u00a0Survive the trapper attacks and find all 10 hidden treasures to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HIGHLY DYNAMIC &amp; DESTRUCTIBLE LEVELS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Level_Previews.gif?t=1747081884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/WaterPropagation.gif?t=1747081884\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Knockback_Destruction.gif?t=1747081884\" />The levels in BANDIT TRAP are highly dynamic and destructible\u2014which means no single match will be the same. Blast holes in walls? Check. Propagating water that seeps through cracks to flood rooms? Double check. Turn rooms into ice-rinks? Triple check. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More information will be revealed leading up to launch so stay tuned!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2982360?t=1747081884","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2982360?t=1747081884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747081884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747081884","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend your home and its treasures against a bandit invasion using inventive boobytraps as a Trapper, or join a team of three Bandits and try to get away with the loot!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introducing <strong>BANDIT TRAP</strong>\u2014a fresh 3vs1, chaotically fun, physics-driven online multiplayer game for the whole family. And yes, we're including a procedurally slapstick damage feature to really fry, blast, burn, soak, scratch, squash &amp; knock those pesky Bandits out!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Trapper_Header_Banner.jpg?t=1747081884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Trapper_Prepare.gif?t=1747081884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Setup tons of boobytraps to defend your house from storming bandits. Use the Trapper Towers to keep watch and strategically place a wide variety of traps hidden in furniture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Trapper_Defend.gif?t=1747081884\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Activate your traps remotely from Trapper Towers or enter trapped furniture and attack bandits directly for more damage. Knock-out the Bandits to 100% Damage to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Bandit_Header_Banner.jpg?t=1747081884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Bandit_Invade.gif?t=1747081884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategise with your crew, choose the right gear, perks and map out tactics before the match starts. Choose wisely and outsmart the Trapper with the right setup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Bandit_Loot.gif?t=1747081884\" />Evade traps, fight the Trapper and master a huge variety of scanners and tools to loot hidden treasures.\u00a0Survive the trapper attacks and find all 10 hidden treasures to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HIGHLY DYNAMIC &amp; DESTRUCTIBLE LEVELS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Level_Previews.gif?t=1747081884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/WaterPropagation.gif?t=1747081884\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/Knockback_Destruction.gif?t=1747081884\" />The levels in BANDIT TRAP are highly dynamic and destructible\u2014which means no single match will be the same. Blast holes in walls? Check. Propagating water that seeps through cracks to flood rooms? Double check. Turn rooms into ice-rinks? Triple check. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More information will be revealed leading up to launch so stay tuned!</strong></p>","developers":["PICOMY"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/bb9207bde36e513f5f099bf35e3903ce48ad8eee/header.jpg?t=1747081884","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 PICOMY. All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 Max and up<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 Max and up<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136756,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136756/movie480.mp4?t=1747037565","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136756/movie_max.mp4?t=1747037565"},"name":"Bandit Trap Story Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136756/aace27d540c9d3dc80b049c1b87dd8783cd88360/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747037565","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136756/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747037565","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136756/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747037565"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257024869,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257024869/movie480.mp4?t=1747037569","max":"http://video